<title>USA: Nabisco Holdings Q1 net per share rises.</title>
<headline>Nabisco Holdings Q1 net per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.24		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net			 64,000		   53,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,905,000		1,990,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 268,606		  266,817</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Nabisco Holdings Corp.</p>
<p>Q1 results reflect efficiencies gained from 1996 restructuring and reduced effective income tax rate, which the company expects to maintain for 1997.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 operating income $196 million, vs $181 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $0.23 per share.</p>
<p>RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp affiliate.</p>
</text>
